From 5edcb08ee24e4da940ed9f384b948b8f0b6fbe26 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: plotarmordev <299844489+plotarmordev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 11:13:17 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 18/30] speech: a Drama 3 reply that reaches max_frames returns
 its clipped audio

A synthesis that reaches max_frames without an end of speech keeps the audio of those frames, as the reference
returns its capped replies, instead of failing without audio. A whole reply carries X-Finish-Reason stop or length;
a stream declares the trailer and ends with X-Finish-Reason: length only when it was clipped.
---
 CHANGELOG.md                          |  1 +
 zig/src/native/drama_host.zig         | 25 +++++++++-----
 zig/src/server/speech.zig             | 24 ++++++++------
 zig/src/server/speech_stream_test.zig | 47 ++++++++++++++++++++-------
 4 files changed, 67 insertions(+), 30 deletions(-)

diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
